  {
    "speaker": "友人１",
    "text": "ヤバ、もう授業終わり？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "友人２",
    "text": "全然まとまってないのに～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013005020060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……レポートの方向性は大体話し合えたわよね\r\nそれなら後は分担を決めれば進められるわ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
