      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101300502/1013005020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013005020070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "この会社の話は、アナタがしてくれたわよね？\r\nここ、頼んでも大丈夫かしら？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300502/1013005020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "友人３",
    "text": "え……あ、もちろん……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013005020080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ふたりは他のレポートもあるのよね？\r\nそれなら、ここ２か所のまとめ、お願いできる？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300502/1013005020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "友人２",
    "text": "うん\r\nでもそうすると、夏葉ちゃんが大変じゃない？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "友人１",
    "text": "ビジネスの成功例のまとめとか、分析とか……\r\nて言っても、この中だと夏葉が一番できそうかな……あはは",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013005020090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ、問題ないわ\r\n任せてちょうだい",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300502/1013005020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013005020100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "来週提出だから……木曜の授業後にまとめるのはどう？\r\n自分の作業はそれまでに終わらせておく形で",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300502/1013005020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "友人３",
    "text": "う、うん……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013005020110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ありがとう。急いで決めてしまってごめんなさい\r\nそれじゃあ木曜に",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300502/1013005020110"
  },
